}<{x}_{2}<…<{x}_{n}=b\\,.\n$$\n\nWe can express $P$ using set notation as\n\n$$\nP={{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{n}}.\n$$\n\n \n\nWith that in mind, let's consider each statement:\n\n- Statement I is a partition of $[-10,-2].$\n\n- Statement II is not a partition of $[-10,-2]$  since it does not include the left endpoint $a=-10.$\n\n- Statement III is not a partition of $[-10,-2]$ since it does not include the right endpoint $b=-2.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-122935/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2bc800b0-3901-5154-81ac-1ef853017320"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-122935"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-122938/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "83214b58-8a81-536b-bbf3-888499b14c07" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122938/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "f54e2c75-fa11-5268-8dde-343d9fb9219e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122938/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "3067162a-79fa-5321-b834-81b4aa2acd5b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122938/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "14ea9cfc-c7cd-5b24-a55d-73411d7d0fb2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122938/selection/1f98f6c0c373a51f1494ba4b82a59e1b27b1d01a11fef80af3608c5fd0216c95" :answer/id #uuid "4703da73-27e9-5124-ac19-47b14eb2cbc8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "None of the statements give a partition of $[0,4]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "